            "target_entity_instance": "North Pacific",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "westerlies produces an intensification of the northern branch of the North Pacific Gyre, which is stronger on the eastern part compared to the western part.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
