            "target_entity_instance": "Atlantic Ocean",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "These two processes occur also in the Atlantic Ocean. The first is associated with an intensification of the Gulf Stream current at around 40\u00b0 N due to stronger winds at this location (Fig. 8), which leads to a warming of the western Atlantic between 40 and 50\u00b0 N.",
